  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Add the boiling water and salt to a large saucepan.\n• Cook fusilli in boiling water, stirring occasionally, until ‘al dente’, 12 mins. Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) and drain pasta.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6789a3d42bc8ddd5f3fb3846-e5ebde9c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Trim green beans and slice into thirds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6789a3d42bc8ddd5f3fb3846-f0e021f4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tomato and green beans, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, 4-6 mins. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in cream, reserved pasta water, garlic seasoning and all-purpose seasoning. Cook for 1 min.\n• Add cooked pasta, baby spinach and Parmesan cheese to the pan. Cook, tossing, until spinach has wilted, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6789a3d42bc8ddd5f3fb3846-13eda051.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy tomato pasta between bowls.\n• Top pasta with a pinch of chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6789a3d42bc8ddd5f3fb3846-6914322b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
